`src/suffixes.json` holds a selection of rules from the Public Suffix List
(https://publicsuffix.org/list/), which is licensed under the Mozilla Public
License 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). That file stays under MPL-2.0.

The confusable-character table in `src/confusables.ts` is a hand-picked subset
of mappings that also appear in Unicode's confusables data (UTS #39,
https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr39/).
